onent to defend immediately to avoid a loss. Importantly, this move also occupies the K7 coordinate, preventing the opponent from playing there to form their own vertical 3-in-a-row (K7-K8-K9), thus maintaining the initiative and preventing a counter-attack.\n\nAnswer: {"col": "K", "row": 7}'}
